  "scientific_assessment": "The exact root successor correctly narrows the missing-fact requirement to per-occurrence ligand/counterion identity and BG11 reference lineage. It preserves all 13 original occurrence IDs, source fields, frozen-case digest, source-context locators, unresolved disposition, empty proposal/owner bindings and publication holds. The factual reading scope matches my sealed assessment: actual Lovley/Coppi/Risso methods and Labarre/Anderson scanned pages, versus Park subscription preview and Shcolnick/Rippka access failures. It does not infer a stock, solvent, counterion, two-ligand species or validated KEGG compound accession from ferric-citrate wording. Original evidence bytes and timestamps are retained; failed routes remain unsuccessful_search. FINAL-CASE13-SUPPLEMENT-09 is explicitly nonapplicable metadata and contributes no support to case13 or grisamine identity.",
